## Shipping

* [Shipping Policy](https://oldyfans.store/policies/shipping-policy): Official shipping, processing, delivery, international shipping, and tracking information.

For US orders, free shipping is available when purchasing two or more t-shirts. Orders are generally processed within 2–5 days. US delivery typically takes an additional 2–5 business days after shipment. International delivery generally takes 4–15 business days, depending in part on customs processing. Customers receive tracking information once an order ships.

